{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-volta-vt40it-incline-treadmill-2608-0247","content_id":"7343f273-40b9-4ceb-b1e9-3df77dd4d824","description":"Product Recall for Volta VT40IT Incline Treadmill presenting a risk of fire. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"439be6d1-0439-46e1-ad1b-33533953437e","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:49:19+01:00","id":"439be6d1-0439-46e1-ad1b-33533953437e","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-10T13:49:19+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa2a74f5f6e942efe37f0dc/2608-0247-product-recall-volta-incline-treadmill.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Volta VT40IT Incline Treadmill</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire as it has been identified that certain batches may have a defect that can cause the treadmill to overheat.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment - Exercise Machines (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Volta / Fitness Superstore</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Affected serial number</td>\n      <td>04-VT40IT-50133099</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Affected orders placed</td>\n      <td>Between July 2025 – November 2025</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A black treadmill with handles, display screen and adjustable incline levels.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_439be6d1-0439-46e1-ad1b-33533953437e\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa2a74f5f6e942efe37f0dc/2608-0247-product-recall-volta-incline-treadmill.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire as it has been identified that certain batches may have a defect that can cause the treadmill to overheat. If the product were to overheat, it could ignite and cause a fire.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<p>Affected consumers have been contacted directly by Fitness Superstore. Owners are advised to switch off their treadmill immediately and unplug it from the mains electricity supply.</p>\n\n<p>Consumers should then check the serial number located on the underside of the treadmill’s main frame to determine whether it contains 50133099.</p>\n\n<p>If the product is affected, Fitness Superstore will arrange a free collection of the treadmill and provide a full refund.</p>\n\n<p>Alternatively, where collection cannot reasonably be arranged, Fitness Superstore may authorise the customer to dispose of the treadmill. In such cases, a full refund will be issued upon receipt of evidence of disposal and a signed declaration.</p>\n\n<p>The Fitness Superstore recall team can be contacted on 01604 673 004, or via email on: <a href=\"mailto:VT40recall@fitness-superstore.co.uk\">VT40recall@fitness-superstore.co.uk</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2608-0247</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-10T12:49:47Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-09-10","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-09-10T13:49:47+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-volta-vt40it-incline-treadmill-2608-0247","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-volta-vt40it-incline-treadmill-2608-0247","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-volta-vt40it-incline-treadmill-2608-0247","content_id":"7343f273-40b9-4ceb-b1e9-3df77dd4d824","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-09-10T12:49:47Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Volta VT40IT Incline Treadmill (2608-0247)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-volta-vt40it-incline-treadmill-2608-0247","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"te